avantage à être formulée briè-\nvement, inclut la source de la référence et le ou les symptômes\nprincipaux.\nÉtude de cas Sophie est référée par son enseignant. Il\ndemande d’évaluer la possibilité non seulement de problèmes\nphysiques, mais également de facteurs psy chologiques ou psy-\nchiatriques contributifs à ses maux de ventre intermittents qui\nl’empêchent d’aller à l’école.\n55.1.3 Antécédents personnels\nLes antécédents personnels comprennent les antécédents mé-\ndicaux, psychiatriques et psychosociaux.\n","repair_count":0,"repair_references":["repair:150:527:unresolved-u+e02b","repair:150:636:unresolved-u+e018","repair:150:730:unresolved-u+e02b","repair:150:773:unresolved-u+e018","repair:150:865:unresolved-u+e033","repair:150:884:unresolved-u+e033","repair:150:946:unresolved-u+e02b","repair:150:1009:unresolved-u+e02b","repair:150:1038:unresolved-u+e033","repair:150:1254:unresolved-u+e018","repair:150:1426:unresolved-u+e018","repair:150:1706:unresolved-u+e00e","repair:150:1746:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:150:2031:unresolved-u+e00d","repair:150:2376:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:150:2468:unresolved-u+e00e","repair:150:2690:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:150:3140:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:150:3272:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:150:3288:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:150:3563:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:150:4152:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:150:4832:unresolved-u+e00f","repair:150:4848:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:150:5261:unresolved-u+e00c"],"source_page_display":151,"source_page_index":150,"unresolved_count":25}
