est-à-dire des dimensions dont la variation modifie la\n","text_sha256":"098ac2d66488a5707733edd746c1629f720792b637a89dfb85005665978bc52a"},{"bbox":[56.25,425.0022888183594,287.8804931640625,437.320068359375],"block_index":10,"block_no":10,"block_type":0,"text":"ENCADRÉ 58.1 Critères diagnostiques du syndrome de Rett\n","text_sha256":"f32d6ede15f5e76e25877e1a8a742b77d42e37b1a399cd671db827f87b738b99"},{"bbox":[118.3499984741211,443.37286376953125,232.1939697265625,464.39239501953125],"block_index":11,"block_no":11,"block_type":0,"text":"DSM-IV-TR\n299.80 (F84.2) Syndrome de Rett\n","text_sha256":"e3792441bb1efa8cc16367d7a19cc089760c366d74d6fd8bb1a61693515a0edc"},{"bbox":[58.25,470.8519592285156,198.09268188476562,480.6781311035156],"block_index":12,"block_no":12,"block_type":0,"text":"A. Présence de tous les éléments suivants :\n","text_sha256":"524345a1f7bae2103b1ded0ab76d1b4d92aefb340ee0ccf1b745570c6ff8d7f9"},{"bbox":[69.25,481.8519592285156,276.22589111328125,502.6781311035156],"block_index":13,"block_no":13,"block_type":0,"text":"(1) développement prénatal et périnatal apparemment normal ;\n(2) développement psychomoteur apparemment normal pendant\n","text_sha256":"ec9fbd296717246ba326770af7c4dc94ef17da49208f2a252940162da5728ffc"},{"bbox":[69.25,502.8519592285156,212.30282592773438,523.6781616210938],"block_index":14,"block_no":14,"block_type":0,"text":"les 5 premiers mois après la naissance ;\n(3) périmètre crânien normal à la naissance.\n","text_sha256":"67dafbfd33d786bb7ff5ee01a6af044afd2090daa2b70505b74fbd357aa623d1"},{"bbox":[58.25,528.3019409179688,289.4631652832031,538.1281127929688],"block_index":15,"block_no":15,"block_type":0,"text":"B. Survenue, après la période initiale de développement normal, de tous\n","text_sha256":"c6431717e2f986ca84ec4a87ec803a722d4d1a3a5461889d666125c45b87fd73"},{"bbox":[69.05000305175781,538.3019409179688,289.7073669433594,570.1281127929688],"block_index":16,"block_no":16,"block_type":0,"text":"les éléments suivants :\n(1) déc