s deux aections. Les dicultés d’interaction sociale\nliées aux TSA (p. ex., rejet par les pairs) peuvent quelquefois\nêtre interprétées comme secondaires au TDA/H. En eet, des\n","text_sha256":"3c58aa5256fe3f899ac1ea18fc7256f08f43343448b75ccff862124e1303a523"},{"bbox":[50.400001525878906,41.002296447753906,412.3818664550781,53.320068359375],"block_index":7,"block_no":7,"block_type":0,"text":"TABLEAU 58.3 Comparaison de la symptomatologie des troubles du spectre de l’autisme\n","text_sha256":"6e20d22d8d5cd89cda2e35b8f6aaf558b494a1e4ad68f79125294383a30518bd"},{"bbox":[108.1500015258789,52.852294921875,269.0466003417969,64.820068359375],"block_index":8,"block_no":8,"block_type":0,"text":"et du syndrome de Gilles de la Tourette\n","text_sha256":"cc7e748d7f4ed6662b05528b81f0ac4c195a9dce50f9465f82d3e8ae13b26173"},{"bbox":[170.75,69.77412414550781,495.59881591796875,80.35029602050781],"block_index":9,"block_no":9,"block_type":0,"text":"Troubles du spectre de l’autisme\nSyndrome de Gilles de la Tourette\n","text_sha256":"b1f8652b483b9b42bca52571eb84735dc159c5385f0b05c91decf0cce2217dad"},{"bbox":[52.25,85.62285614013672,486.49298095703125,95.64238739013672],"block_index":10,"block_no":10,"block_type":0,"text":"Âge de début du trouble\n• Avant 3 ans\n• Vers 5-6 ans (tics qui permettent de l’identier)\n","text_sha256":"3c167f50bfc5af5e5c14c2bd4910e499e9f4e63039f305bb3cf13ed31971f139"},{"bbox":[52.25,104.0728530883789,132.8679962158203,124.0923843383789],"block_index":11,"block_no":11,"block_type":0,"text":"Âge de début des mou-\nvements, des tics\n","text_sha256":"f94679cb01b1c253276bbf00190ae8d04f3a898962ef330ef65f2ab8c8d7d8f5"},{"bbox":[144.0,104.1519546508789,471.2388610839844,124.9781265258789],"block_index":12,"block_no":12,"block_type":0,"text":"• Avant 3 ans pour les stéréotypies\n• Vers 6 ans pour les tics moteurs et vocaux\n• Vers 9 ans pour les tics verbaux\n","text_sha256":"e13a702f1f3a31e965571c637618ea7fbd7a66418d0454cf2125987ca3bd5f3f"},{"bbox":[52.25,133.472