ections médicales, tels les troubles cardiaques ou respiratoires,\ntend à en fausser la prévalence. Les médecins sont portés à sur-\névaluer le caractère adaptatif des symptômes anxieux chez les\npersonnes âgées qui se plaignent moins de leur anxiété parce qu’elles\n","repair_count":0,"repair_references":["repair:351:298:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:471:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:351:793:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:923:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:351:1039:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:1454:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:351:1479:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:1677:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:2044:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:351:2111:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:2218:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:351:3066:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:3234:unresolved-u+e00e","repair:351:3280:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:351:3379:unresolved-u+e00e","repair:351:4292:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:4916:unresolved-u+e00c","repair:351:5118:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:5364:unresolved-u+e00a","repair:351:6315:unresolved-u+e00e","repair:351:6652:unresolved-u+e00a"],"source_page_display":352,"source_page_index":351,"unresolved_count":21}
